//
// Fix 2: Detect residual {curly} contamination with ExtractContentBetweenDelimiters
//   + CountSubstring("{"). If braceCount > 0, trigger Phase 3 even when closeCount > 0.
//   This gives a hard fallback for any examples that ignore the guidance. The
//   evaluator uses the LAST complete visible span, so the forced final <<expr>>
//   supersedes any earlier invalid ones.
